  "description": "Hookz adds composable middleware-style hooks to your Minimal API endpoints, enabling clean pre-processing, post-processing, and finalization logic without cluttering your handlers.\n\nWhether you're logging requests, injecting metrics, short-circuiting bad input, or decorating responses, Hookz lets you do it inline, fluently, and with full access to the HttpContext.",
